abstract: "QR Live Protocol (QRLP) — Python toolkit that generates live, verifiable QR codes carrying NTP-synced timestamps, Bitcoin/Ethereum block hashes, HMAC and public-key signatures, plus OpenTimestamps attestation. Flask/SocketIO server drops into OBS Studio as a browser source, with a tested codebase."
